<h2>Madison claim questions</h2><div class="faq"><details><summary>My Middleton-area basement flooded in a big rainstorm. Can appraisal help?</summary><div class="a"><p>If your carrier agrees part of the loss is covered but disputes the amount, appraisal can settle that number. Whether surface water or seepage is covered at all is a coverage question that appraisal does not decide.</p></div></details><details><summary>I live in a Madison condo. Who handles the roof claim?</summary><div class="a"><p>Usually the association’s master policy covers the roof and common elements, while your unit policy covers interior improvements and belongings. Your association documents control the details.</p></div></details></div>
